IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CCRDLST.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CARD-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-C-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CN-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-C-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD CARD-FILE.
01 CARD-REC.
   COPY "CCRD".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-C-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-C-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "CCRDQP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-CCRD-LIST.
    MOVE "00" TO QL-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO QL-MSG
    MOVE 0 TO QL-COUNT
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-C-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/crdcard.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-C-PATH
    EVALUATE QL-OP
        WHEN "CARDS" PERFORM SCAN-CARDS
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO QL-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN CARD LIST OP" TO QL-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

SCAN-CARDS.
    OPEN INPUT CARD-FILE
    IF WS-C-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "00" TO QL-RC
        CLOSE CARD-FILE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ CARD-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM TAKE-CARD
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE CARD-FILE.

TAKE-CARD.
    IF QL-CUST NOT = SPACES
        IF CN-CUST-ID OF CARD-REC NOT = QL-CUST
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF QL-FSTAT NOT = SPACES
        IF CN-STATUS OF CARD-REC NOT = QL-FSTAT
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF QL-FACILITY NOT = SPACES
        IF CN-FACILITY OF CARD-REC NOT = QL-FACILITY
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF QL-ACCOUNT NOT = SPACES
        IF CN-ACCOUNT OF CARD-REC NOT = QL-ACCOUNT
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO QL-COUNT
    IF QL-COUNT > 300
        MOVE "20" TO QL-RC
        MOVE "CARD LIST OVERFLOW" TO QL-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CN-ID OF CARD-REC TO QL-ID(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-STATUS OF CARD-REC TO QL-STATUS(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-KIND OF CARD-REC TO QL-KIND(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-PRODUCT OF CARD-REC TO QL-PRODUCT(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-MASKED OF CARD-REC TO QL-MASKED(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-CURRENCY OF CARD-REC TO QL-CURRENCY(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-EXP-DATE OF CARD-REC TO QL-DATE(QL-COUNT)
    MOVE CN-NETWORK OF CARD-REC TO QL-TEXT(QL-COUNT).
